{
  "run_id": "PMC12941970__expert_context__pcd_nocritic_PCD_o3mini__s2",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The starting material is an as-cast CoCrFeNi high-entropy alloy.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed lubricant is a 2D high-entropy material analogous to (MoWNbTaV)0.2S2 nanoflakes.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12019924::web::022::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "(MoWNbTaV)0.2S2 nanoflakes can be applied by spray coating.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12019924::web::022::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray deposition will produce a thin, adherent coating on CoCrFeNi.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will be interfacially bonded, layered, and quasi-two-dimensional.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12019924::web::022::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sliding will convert the nanoflake coating into a continuous lubricious tribolayer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::016::formation_of_amorphous_carbon",
        "PMC12019924::web::022::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical stress and frictional energy activate the nanoflakes during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Catalytically active (MoWNbTaV)0.2S2 nanoflakes can dissociate residual ethanol and promote formation of an amorphous-carbon tribolayer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::016::formation_of_amorphous_carbon",
        "PMC12019924::web::022::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adventitious hydrocarbons or unspecified ambient species will provide suitable tribocatalytic reactants under the proposed CoCrFeNi tests.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::016::formation_of_amorphous_carbon",
        "PMC12019924::web::022::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting tribolayer will reduce interfacial shear strength and direct metal-to-metal contact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12019924::web::022::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tribolayer will suppress both adhesive and oxidative wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coated CoCrFeNi will have significantly lower and more consistent coefficients of friction than uncoated CoCrFeNi from room temperature through 800 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coated CoCrFeNi will have lower wear rates than uncoated CoCrFeNi from room temperature through 800 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will remain effective in ambient air under moderate-to-high variable loads.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will remain effective throughout the full room-temperature-to-800 °C range.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Performance may decline if the coating delaminates or loses integrity during prolonged high-temperature exposure or extreme environments.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12019924::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Long-term coating adhesion and tribocatalytic kinetics across temperature and load remain uncertain.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coated and uncoated CoCrFeNi specimens will be compared by ball-on-disk testing in ambient air while temperature and normal load are varied.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.design",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Friction, wear volume, coating integrity, and tribolayer composition and structure will be measured.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.measurements",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure to obtain consistently and significantly lower friction and wear across the full temperature range, or loss of coating integrity, will falsify the hypothesis.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
